#face-image: img/portraits/BellRudolf.jpg

= Vendrin Bell

Bell is an economist and a disciple of Corwin Vael. Originating from Avriza, the Freehold, he trained as a medical doctor, but later became involved in Vaelist economics as a discipline. He has been the lead ideologist of our party since the Heidelberg Program of 1925.

