@against_right_and_left
title: Against Right and Left
subtitle: As a Centrist, Bell seeks to steer a course between the party's factions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; advisor_action_time = time; center_strength += 10; left_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; knight_strength -= 5; center_dissent -= 10

We have reduced the strength of the dissident factions in the party.

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Bell supports cooperation with the propertied parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_toleration: The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: marcher_in_government = 0 and marcher_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; knight_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.

@finance_ministry_
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: As Finance Minister, Bell can enact tax policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if marcher_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> not in government: ?] [? if finance_minister_party != "Marcher" : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> does not control the finance ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and marcher_in_government == 1 and finance_minister_party == "Marcher"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@economic_democracy_
title: Economic Democracy
subtitle: Enact policies to build a more democratic economy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if marcher_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "Marcher" or (finance_minister_party != "Marcher" and economic_minister_party != "Marcher") : We do not have the necessary government ministers. ?] [? if concord_economy_accepted : Our coalition agreement stipulates against socialization. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and marcher_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "Marcher" or finance_minister_party == "Marcher") and (labor_minister_party == "Marcher")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_democracy
